    "可變幀率。畫面本身的節奏就不均勻。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Variable frame rate. The footage itself is unevenly paced."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可变帧率。画面本身的节奏就不均匀。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可變幀率。畫面本身的節奏就不均勻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "呈現時間戳不單調遞增，片源的時間資訊有問題。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Presentation timestamps are not monotonically increasing — the source has broken timing information."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "呈现时间戳不单调递增，片源的时间信息有问题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "呈現時間戳不單調遞增，片源的時間資訊有問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "唯一能讓影片出現在**鎖屏**的做法。影片需拷進 extension（受輪替上限管制），且要在「系統設定 → 桌布」選片。依賴私有 API，macOS 大版本可能失效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The only way to get video onto the **lock screen**. Videos have to be copied into the extension (subject to the rotation budget) and picked in System Settings → Wallpaper. Relies on private API, so a major macOS release may break it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "唯一能让视频出现在**锁屏**的做法。视频需拷进 extension（受轮换上限管制），且要在“系统设置 → 墙纸”选片。依赖私有 API，macOS 大版本可能失效。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "唯一能讓影片出現在**鎖屏**的做法。影片需拷進 extension（受輪替上限管制），且要在「系統設定 → 桌布」選片。依賴私有 API，macOS 大版本可能失效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
