            "value": "影片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "影片幀率與螢幕更新率不整除，會有規律微頓。這是呈現節奏，不是播放器故障。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The frame rate does not divide evenly into the display refresh rate, which causes regular micro-stutter. This is presentation cadence, not a player fault."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频帧率与屏幕刷新率不整除，会有规律微顿。这是呈现节奏，不是播放器故障。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "影片幀率與螢幕更新率不整除，會有規律微頓。這是呈現節奏，不是播放器故障。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "影片幀率高於螢幕更新率，必然有畫格被丟棄。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The frame rate is higher than the display refresh rate, so frames are necessarily dropped."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频帧率高于屏幕刷新率，必然有画格被丢弃。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "影片幀率高於螢幕更新率，必然有畫格被丟棄。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "影片軌起點不是 0，循環接縫需要正規化才不會錯位。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The video track does not start at 0, so the loop seam needs normalising to stay aligned."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "视频轨起点不是 0，循环接缝需要正规化才不会错位。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "影片軌起點不是 0，循環接縫需要正規化才不會錯位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
