    "每支影片各自抽一種（填滿螢幕／符合螢幕大小）。同一支在同一台螢幕上抽到的固定不變。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each video draws its own mode (Fill Screen / Fit to Screen). The same video on the same display always draws the same one."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个视频各自抽一种（填满屏幕／符合屏幕大小）。同一个在同一台屏幕上抽到的固定不变。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
