    "片源不在本機磁碟上，讀取可能斷續。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The source is not on a local disk, so reads may stall."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "片源不在本机磁盘上，读取可能断续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "片源不在本機磁碟上，讀取可能斷續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "直接播來源檔，不拷貝、不佔額外磁碟，整個片庫都能播。全公開 API。**鎖屏不會播。**": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plays source files directly — no copying, no extra disk, your whole library is playable. Public API only. **Does not play on the lock screen.**"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接播来源文件，不拷贝、不占额外磁盘，整个视频库都能播。全公开 API。**锁屏不会播。**"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "直接播來源檔，不拷貝、不佔額外磁碟，整個片庫都能播。全公開 API。**鎖屏不會播。**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "站上有多好就拿多好。快取會很快滿。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Takes the best the site offers. The cache fills up fast."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "站上有多好就拿多好。缓存会很快满。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "站上有多好就拿多好。快取會很快滿。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "符合螢幕大小": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fit to Screen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "符合屏幕大小"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "符合螢幕大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "等比放大到蓋滿螢幕，超出畫面的裁掉。不會有黑邊，但拍到的東西可能被切到。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scales up until the screen is covered and crops the overflow. No bars, but part of the frame may be cut off."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等比放大到盖满屏幕，超出画面的裁掉。不会有黑边，但拍到的东西可能被切到。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等比放大到蓋滿螢幕，超出畫面的裁掉。不會有黑邊，但拍到的東西可能被切到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "等比縮到整支影片都看得見。長寬比跟螢幕不一樣就會留黑邊。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scales down until the whole frame is visible. Leaves bars whenever the aspect ratio differs from the screen."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等比缩到整个视频都看得见。长宽比跟屏幕不一样就会留黑边。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
